時に、\n後ろから呼ばれてハテナな表情でキャンディーにかじりついたまま、\nこちらを振り返っている様子をお願いします。\nるーちゃん視点で左に振り返って、しっぽは伸ばしてください、\nしっぽに重心を預けると思うんです。\n\n出来ればるーちゃんのサムネなどに使わせてあげてください！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@devil_micaela/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1907085865136066560%2FJvDQ1qbd.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=0cd2db74870c02d17feae1fb1ef06761", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1907085865136066560%2FJvDQ1qbd.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=0cd2db74870c02d17feae1fb1ef06761, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1907085865136066560%2FJvDQ1qbd.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=3a13d57575f25be3b95a6e85ce5fe3af 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1907085865136066560%2FJvDQ1qbd.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=5a6b74aaa3faa0d1facbd274623f9efa 3x", "genre": "voice", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}